      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPlease note: All levies have been paid up to date in relation to the well-documented Bru na Sionna fire defect issues. This property is only suitable for cash buyers, as mortgage finance is not currently available until the fire remediation works have been fully completed.\n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present to the market 224 Bru na Sionna, Shannon, Co. Clare.\n\nA well-presented two-bedroom first floor apartment ideally located in the popular Bru na Sionna development, just a short walk from Shannon Town Centre, Shannon Town Park and a wide range of local amenities. Offering excellent value for money, this spacious apartment is an ideal choice for cash buyers seeking a home or investment property in a convenient location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a bright open plan kitchen, dining and living area, two generously sized bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, and a main family bathroom.\n\nA standout feature of the property is the double-sided balcony, with the rear overlooking a lovely green area, providing an attractive outdoor space to enjoy. The apartment also benefits from a designated parking space.\n\nBru na Sionna is within walking distance of shops, cafés, schools, leisure facilities and Shannon Town Centre. Shannon Airport, the M18 motorway and a number of major employers are all just minutes away, making it an excellent location for commuters.\n\nAdditional features include mains gas central heating, PVC double glazed windows, a B3 BER, a designated parking space, a double-sided balcony overlooking a green area to the rear and bright, well-maintained accommodation throughout.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious apartment offering exceptional value for money in a highly convenient Shannon location. Early viewing is highly recommended without delay."
      },
